"I am your sign; the net spread for the prince in Jerusalem; bread eaten with quaking; the foolish prophets like foxes in the waste places, and the wall daubed with untempered mortar brought down by the stormy wind; and though these three men, Noah, Daniel, and Job, were in it.": "我作你们的预兆；网撒在耶路撒冷的君王身上；吃饭必胆战；愚顽的先知好像荒场中的狐狸，用未泡透的灰抹上的墙被狂风吹裂；其中虽有挪亚、但以理、约伯这三人。",
"I have loved you, saith Jehovah": "耶和华说：我曾爱你们",
"I have loved you, saith Jehovah; a son honoreth his father; behold, I send my messenger; will a man rob God?; a book of remembrance; the sun of righteousness with healing in its wings; and Elijah the prophet before the great and terrible day of Jehovah": "耶和华说：我曾爱你们；儿子尊敬父亲；我要差遣我的使者；人岂可夺取神之物呢？纪念册；公义的日头，其光线有医治之能；耶和华大而可畏之日未到以前，先知以利亚",
"I have set thee a watchman unto the house of Israel; have I any pleasure in the death of the wicked? turn ye, turn ye; one that had escaped out of Jerusalem: The city is smitten; then woe unto the shepherds of Israel that feed themselves": "我立你作以色列家守望的人；我断不喜悦恶人死亡，你们转回，转回吧；有人从耶路撒冷逃来，说：「城已攻破」；然后，祸哉！以色列的牧人只知牧养自己",
"I myself will search for my sheep, and I will set up one shepherd over them, even my servant David, and a covenant of peace.": "我必亲自寻找我的羊，我必立一牧人照管他们，就是我的仆人大卫，并立平安的约。",
"I will be unto her a wall of fire round about; Joshua the high priest in filthy garments, and a clean mitre upon his head; the stone with seven eyes; a candlestick all of gold and two olive-trees": "我要作耶路撒冷四围的火城；大祭司约书亚穿着污秽的衣服，洁净的冠冕戴在他头上；有七眼的石头；纯金的灯台和两棵橄榄树",
"I will shake all nations, and the latter glory of this house shall be greater than the former; holy flesh in the skirt of a garment; from this day will I bless you; and I will make thee as a signet.": "我必震动万国，这殿后来的荣耀必大过先前的荣耀；用衣襟兜圣肉；从今日起，我必赐福与你们；我必以你为印。",
"I will sprinkle clean water upon you, and a new heart also will I give you; then the valley full of bones, very dry: Son of man, can these bones live?": "我必用清水洒在你们身上，也要赐给你们一个新心；然后遍满骸骨的平原，极其枯干：人子啊，这些骸骨能复活吗？",
