"and very many trees on its banks, the sea healed and the fishers spreading their nets, every tree for food and the leaf for healing; the border of the land, the stranger inheriting among the tribes; the twelve tribes each one portion from the east side unto the west side, the holy oblation in the midst; the city foursquare with three gates on every side after the names of the tribes; and the name of the city from that day shall be, Jehovah is there.": "岸上有极多的树木，海水变甜，渔夫在那里晒网，果子可作食物，叶子乃为治病；地的四界，寄居的外人在支派中同得地业；十二支派从东到西各得一分，圣供地在其中；城是四方的，每面有三门，按以色列支派的名字；从此以后，这城的名字必称为「耶和华的所在」。",
"behold, the man whose name is the Branch; the men of Bethel asking of the fasts": "看哪，那名称为大卫苗裔的；伯特利人问禁食的事",
"bone to its bone, come from the four winds, O breath, and they stood up upon their feet, an exceeding great army; the two sticks made one; and my sanctuary in the midst of them for evermore.": "骨与骨互相联络，气息啊，要从四方而来，骸骨便站起来，成为极大的军队；两根木杖接连为一；我的圣所在他们中间，直到永远。",
