"but Jonah rose up to flee unto Tarshish, and went down to Joppa; a great wind upon the sea, the mariners crying every man unto his god, and Jonah fast asleep; the lot fell upon Jonah": "约拿却起来，逃往他施去，下到约帕；耶和华使海中起大风，水手各人哀求自己的神，约拿躺卧沉睡；掣签掣出约拿来",
"cast into the fire for fuel; then Jerusalem, cast out in the open field in the day that she was born, washed and clothed and decked with ornaments, who trusted in her beauty; her lovers and her judgment; Samaria and Sodom her sisters; and nevertheless I will remember my covenant with thee in the days of thy youth.": "抛在火中当作柴烧；然后耶路撒冷，初生的日子扔在田野，被水洗净，穿上绣花衣服，用妆饰打扮，却仗着自己的美貌；她所爱的和她所受的审判；她的姊妹撒马利亚和所多玛；然而我要追念在你幼年时与你所立的约。",
"execute true judgment, and show kindness; I am returned unto Zion: old men and old women in the streets of Jerusalem, and boys and girls playing; ten men shall take hold of the skirt of a Jew.": "要按至理判断，各人以慈爱怜悯弟兄；我现在回到锡安：年老的男女坐在耶路撒冷街上，男孩女孩在街上玩耍；十个人拉住一个犹大人的衣襟。",
"he will rejoice over thee with joy, he will joy over thee with singing.": "他必因你欢欣喜乐，且因你喜乐而欢呼。",
"is it a time for you to dwell in your ceiled houses, while this house lieth waste? consider your ways: ye have sown much, and bring in little, wages into a bag with holes; go up to the mountain, and bring wood; Zerubbabel and Joshua and the remnant obeyed, and came and did work; be strong, all ye people of the land": "这殿仍然荒凉，你们自己还住天花板的房屋吗？你们要省察自己的行为：你们撒的种多，收的却少，将工钱装在破漏的囊中；你们要上山取木料；所罗巴伯、约书亚和剩下的百姓都听从，就来做工；这地的百姓，你们都当刚强",
"is it a time for you to dwell in your ceiled houses, while this house lieth waste? consider your ways; be strong, and work, for I am with you; the latter glory of this house shall be greater than the former; and Zerubbabel as a signet": "这殿仍然荒凉，你们自己还住天花板的房屋吗？你们要省察自己的行为；你们都当刚强做工，因为我与你们同在；这殿后来的荣耀必大过先前的荣耀；所罗巴伯为印",
"not by might, nor by power, but by my Spirit, saith Jehovah of hosts.": "万军之耶和华说：不是倚靠势力，不是倚靠才能，乃是倚靠我的灵方能成事。",
"salvation is of Jehovah": "救恩出于耶和华",
