"the appearance of the likeness of the glory of Jehovah; the roll of a book eaten, in the mouth as honey; and I have made thee a watchman unto the house of Israel.": "耶和华荣耀的形象；吃了书卷，口中其甜如蜜；我立你作以色列家守望的人。",
"the cedar mast, the linen sail of Egypt, her traffickers from Tarshish to Sheba": "香柏树做的桅杆，埃及细麻布做的篷帆，从他施到示巴与她交易的客商",
"the chariots rage in the streets, the gates of the rivers are opened, and the palace is dissolved; where is the den of the lions?; woe to the bloody city; art thou better than No-amon?; thy shepherds slumber, O king of Assyria.": "车辆在街上急行，河闸开放，宫殿冲没；狮子的洞在哪里呢？祸哉！这流人血的城；你岂比挪亚们强呢？亚述王啊，你的牧人睡觉。",
"the gates and their lodges, the outer court and the inner, the altar before the house, the temple and the most holy place, the cherubim with two faces among the palm-trees, the table that is before Jehovah, and the wall of five hundred reeds round about, to separate the holy from the common.": "各门和卫房，外院和内院，殿前的祭坛，殿和至圣所，棕树之间有二脸的基路伯，耶和华面前的桌子，以及四围长五百肘的墙，为要分别圣地与俗地。",
"the great day of Jehovah is near, a day of wrath, a day of darkness and gloominess; seek ye Jehovah, all ye meek of the earth; woe to the oppressing city; and sing, O daughter of Zion, for Jehovah thy God is in the midst of thee": "耶和华的大日临近，那日是忿怒的日子，是黑暗幽冥的日子；世上的谦卑人哪，你们都当寻求耶和华；这欺压的城有祸了；锡安的民哪，应当歌唱，因为耶和华你的神在你中间",
"the horses among the myrtles, the measuring line, Joshua the high priest, the candlestick of gold and the two olive-trees, the flying roll and the four chariots; then thy king cometh unto thee, lowly, and riding upon an ass; the thirty pieces of silver; a fountain opened; and the day of Jehovah, when his feet shall stand upon the mount of Olives": "番石榴树中间的马，准绳，大祭司约书亚，纯金的灯台和两棵橄榄树，飞行的书卷和四辆车；然后你的王来到你这里，谦谦和和地骑着驴；三十块钱；开一个泉源；以及耶和华的日子，那日他的脚必站在橄榄山上",
"the house of Israel become dross in the furnace, and I sought for a man that should stand in the gap, but I found none; then two women, the daughters of one mother, Oholah the elder and Oholibah her sister, Samaria and Jerusalem, their lovers and their judgment, and the cup of astonishment and desolation.": "以色列家成为炉中的渣滓，我寻找一人在破口防堵，却找不着一个；然后两个女子，是一母所生，姊姊阿荷拉，妹妹阿荷利巴，就是撒马利亚和耶路撒冷，她们所爱的和她们所受的审判，以及令人惊骇凄凉的杯。",
"the king that despised the oath; a tender twig planted upon the mountain of the height of Israel; the fathers have eaten sour grapes": "轻看所起之誓的王；嫩枝栽于以色列高处的山上；父亲吃了酸葡萄",
"the mountains melted as wax, Zion plowed as a field; then the mountain of Jehovah's house, swords into plowshares, every man under his vine and under his fig-tree; Beth-lehem Ephrathah; what doth Jehovah require of thee; and who is a God like unto thee": "众山消化如蜡，锡安被耕种像一块田；然后耶和华殿的山，将刀打成犁头，人人都坐在自己葡萄树下和无花果树下；伯利恒的以法他；耶和华向你所要的是什么；有何神像你",
"the righteous shall live by his faith; and the prayer of Habakkuk: though the fig-tree shall not flourish, yet I will rejoice in Jehovah": "义人因信得生；哈巴谷的祷告：虽然无花果树不发旺，然而我要因耶和华欢欣",
"the righteous shall live by his faith; the five woes, and Jehovah in his holy temple; then the prayer of Habakkuk: God came from Teman; though the fig-tree shall not flourish, yet I will rejoice in Jehovah.": "义人因信得生；五个祸哉，惟耶和华在他的圣殿中；然后哈巴谷的祷告：神从提幔而来；虽然无花果树不发旺，然而我要因耶和华欢欣。",
"the soul that sinneth, it shall die, and turn yourselves, and live; and a lamentation for the princes of Israel: the lioness and her whelps, and the vine plucked up in fury.": "犯罪的，他必死亡，你们当回头而存活；为以色列的王作哀歌：母狮子和小狮子，以及因忿怒被拔出的葡萄树。",
"then Nineveh, that great city, in sackcloth and ashes, and the gourd that came up in a night and perished in a night": "然后尼尼微大城披上麻布，坐在灰中；那蓖麻一夜发生，一夜干死",
"they shall beat their swords into plowshares, and sit every man under his vine and under his fig-tree.": "他们要将刀打成犁头，人人都要坐在自己葡萄树下和无花果树下。",
"this is the place of my throne; the altar measured and consecrated seven days; the east gate shut, for Jehovah hath entered in by it; and the sons of Zadok in linen garments, who keep the charge of the sanctuary: I am their inheritance.": "这是我宝座之地；量祭坛，七日洁净坛；朝东的门必须关闭，因为耶和华已经由其中进入；撒督的子孙身穿细麻衣，看守我的圣所：我是他们的产业。",
"thou that dwellest in the clefts of the rock, though thou set thy nest among the stars; the day of thy brother's calamity; the day of Jehovah near upon all the nations; and saviours on mount Zion, and the kingdom shall be Jehovah's": "住在山穴中的啊，你虽在星宿之间搭窝；你兄弟遭难的日子；耶和华降罚的日子临近万国；必有拯救者上到锡安山，国度就归耶和华了",
"though thy nest be set among the stars, I will bring thee down from thence; the violence done to thy brother Jacob in the day of his calamity; as thou hast done, it shall be done unto thee; the house of Jacob a fire, the house of Esau stubble; and the kingdom shall be Jehovah's.": "你虽在星宿之间搭窝，我必从那里拉下你来；你向兄弟雅各行强暴，在他遭难的日子；你怎样行，他也必照样向你行；雅各家必成为大火，以扫家必如碎秸；国度就归耶和华了。",
"to the ankles, to the knees, to the loins, a river to swim in": "水到踝子骨，到膝，到腰，成为可洑的水",
"until he come whose right it is.": "直等到那应得的人来到。",
"who knoweth whether God will not turn and repent?; but it displeased Jonah exceedingly: doest thou well to be angry?; the booth on the east side of the city, the gourd, the worm and the sultry east wind; and should not I have regard for Nineveh, that great city?": "或者神转意后悔，也未可知；这事约拿大大不悦：你这样发怒合乎理吗？城的东边搭的棚，蓖麻，虫子和炎热的东风；何况这尼尼微大城，我岂能不爱惜呢？",
"yet ye say, Wherein hast thou loved us?; the blind, the lame and the sick upon mine altar, and from the rising of the sun my name great among the Gentiles; the covenant with Levi; the wife of thy youth; behold, I send my messenger, and he is like a refiner's fire; will a man rob God? bring ye the whole tithe into the store-house, and I will open you the windows of heaven; a book of remembrance; the day that burneth as a furnace; unto you that fear my name shall the sun of righteousness arise with healing in its wings; and I will send you Elijah the prophet.": "你们却说：你在何事上爱我们呢？瞎眼的、瘸腿的、有病的献在我坛上，从日出之地到日落之处，我的名在外邦中必尊为大；与利未所立的约；你幼年所娶的妻；我要差遣我的使者，他如炼金之人的火；人岂可夺取神之物呢？你们要将当纳的十分之一全然送入仓库，我必为你们敞开天上的窗户；纪念册；那日势如烧着的火炉；向你们敬畏我名的人必有公义的日头出现，其光线有医治之能；我必差遣先知以利亚到你们那里去。",
